{"v":4,"catch":"翱翔虛空－征服星空之外的天空。","desc":"掌控您的太空船，投入速度、精準度和探索碰撞的宇宙之旅。探索充滿扭曲的小行星環和輻射天體結構的超現實性、反重力景觀。在每一級中，你需要充分發揮自己的反應能力，躲避障礙物，收集重要能量核心，並揭開深空隱藏的奧秘。只有最敏銳的飛行員才能完成挑戰——您準備好征服宇宙了嗎？","publisher":"Gametry","release":"2025-03-27","genres":["街機","動作","模擬"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6d8e28a20e415780ed51a8b308c48e27c4a61352db7aec993483f3f658b87ce9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c2cdc9a6308d4ba446a961c6a30539e006b994ea9ad9df06e113b7f9c7a72711.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/52dd2ad3590f2094deaaa1b564632735c8f29e547aa16e3de917d0e2aebd586a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4c29ff9b566c4cf12cebef7aa98e7c3569e05c3a65c4b59b89a9991416566aba.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/690ae8f88ad253077ea306169176d77733d7215c64d4c2bea98ffaf61cc16dc7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/19966488c84dfff171522fad645bd70fda69f7c63315881c31b29558fda2c977.jpg"],"titleId":"0100ec3022514000","dlc":[]}